+func _first_overflow_row(needs: Needs) -> int:
+	"""Lowest eligible row whose untreated counter is already INT64_MAX, or -1 when none is.
+
+	Eligibility is exactly the sweep's own: present, carrying an aggregate injury, and living by
+	`needs.gd`'s judgement. Dead, uninjured and inactive rows are skipped here as they are there,
+	so the preflight can never refuse a sweep that would not have touched the row.
+	"""
